          "graphId": "idea-template-dictionary"
        },
        "markdown": "# Idea Template Class Set\n\nTyped anchors: Idea, Problem, Audience, and Proposed Approach.\n\nRepeatable working records: Question, Assumption, Research, Evidence, Alternative, Risk, and Next Step.\n\nSemantic relationships: motivates, affects, assumes, questions, informs, supports, contradicts, tests, threatens, and advances."
